  "user_prompt": "Design a focused analog library of 5 compounds based on Nirmatrelvir (SMILES: CC1(C2CC2NC(=O)C(F)(F)F)CN1C(=O)C(NC(=O)C1CC1(C#N)C)C(C)(C)C) with systematic modifications at key positions to explore SAR against SARS-CoV-2 Mpro. Include SMILES for each analog.\n\nRespond ONLY with JSON in this exact format:\n{\"modifications\": [{\"description\": \"analog 1 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_1\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 1\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 2 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_2\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 2\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 3 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_3\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 3\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 4 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_4\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 4\"}, {\"description\": \"analog 5 description\", \"smiles\": \"SMILES_5\", \"rationale\": \"rationale 5\"}]}",
